@startuml itqan-act-04-messaging
' Itqan — Activity Diagram 04: Teacher messaging
' Built only from Itqan_Requirements.md and USE_CASE_SCENARIOS.md: UC-19 and
' UC-16 with their exceptions; FR-25; BR-12, BR-13.
<style>
root {
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 12
  FontColor #000000
  BackGroundColor #FFFFFF
  LineColor #000000
  LineThickness 0.75
  RoundCorner 0
  Shadowing 0
}

note { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000; FontColor #000000 }

activityDiagram {
  activity    { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000; FontColor #000000; RoundCorner 10 }
  diamond     { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000 }
  activityBar { BackGroundColor #000000; LineColor #000000 }
  arrow       { LineColor #000000; LineThickness 0.75 }
  swimlane    { LineColor #000000; LineThickness 0.75 }
}
</style>

|Teacher|
start
:Send message (UC-19):
pick a class;
if (Whole class or one reader?) then (one reader)
  :Pick an enrolled reader;
else (whole class)
endif
repeat
  :Write message;
  |Itqan System|
backward:Refuse: message empty;
repeat while (Message empty?) is (yes) not (no)
:Check each recipient's active
enrolment; skip any who left;
if (Any actively enrolled recipient?) then (no)
  :Refuse: "this class has no
  readers yet" (nothing stored);
  |Teacher|
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Itqan System|
:Store message, one entry per
recipient, marked unread (BR-12);
|Teacher|
:See message in sent list
with read status per recipient;

|Quran Reader|
:Open inbox (UC-16),
badge shows unread count;
|Itqan System|
:List messages, newest first;
|Quran Reader|
:Open the message;
|Itqan System|
:Record read date: shown as read
to reader and teacher (BR-13);
|Quran Reader|
stop

@enduml
